        "y0": 0.5052620689655173,
        "x1": 0.3671915492957747,
        "y1": 0.5303293103448277
      },
      "text": "(6) Same as (1) ? I had the luck To see, and drink a little pluck. Brome'a Songs, 1661, p. 167.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
