        "y0": 0.5567086206896552,
        "x1": 0.5016056338028169,
        "y1": 0.5837068965517241
      },
      "text": "(7) A student who fails in an university examination is said to be plucked.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5230591549295774,
        "y0": 0.3331068965517241,
        "x1": 0.9546225352112676,
        "y1": 0.34815344827586203
      },
      "text": "PLUM-TREE. The female pudendum. Have",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5441126760563381,
        "y0": 0.34783275862068963,
        "x1": 0.9538169014084508,
        "y1": 0.44219655172413797
      },
      "text": "at the plum tree seems to have been either the burden of a song or a proverbial phrase. It occurs in Middleton, although Mr. Dyce does not seem to be acquainted with the meaning of the term itself, which may be gathered from Cotgrave, in v. Hoche-prunier, and the Mariage of Witt and Wisdome, p. 16.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5222507042253521,
        "y0": 0.44074137931034485,
        "x1": 0.8736478873239436,
        "y1": 0.45599137931034484
      },
      "text": "PLUNGE. (1) A deep pool. Somerset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5214394366197183,
        "y0": 0.4539586206896552,
        "x1": 0.8611098591549297,
        "y1": 0.5090741379310344
      },
      "text": "(2) A strait or difficulty. Greene. PLUNGY. Wet; rainy. {A.-N) PLUNKET. A coarse woollen cloth. PLUNKY. Short ; thick",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7574647887323943,
        "y0": 0.49850172413793103,
        "x1": 0.8886309859154929,
        "y1": 0.5087086206896552
      },
      "text": "; heavy. East.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5214394366197183,
        "y0": 0.507646551724138,
        "x1": 0.9517915492957747,
        "y1": 0.522998275862069
      },
      "text": "PLUNT. A walking-stick, generally one which",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5433014084507043,
        "y0": 0.5245465517241379,
        "x1": 0.7724422535211267,
        "y1": 0.5354637931034483
      },
      "text": "has a large knob. Glouc.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.5359862068965517,
        "x1": 0.859487323943662,
        "y1": 0.549201724137931
      },
      "text": "PLURISY. Superabundance. Shak.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.5491155172413793,
        "x1": 0.9497633802816902,
        "y1": 0.5637189655172414
      },
      "text": "PLUSHES. The thin hoops which hold a besom",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.542087323943662,
        "y0": 0.5658344827586207,
        "x1": 0.6906704225352113,
        "y1": 0.5759431034482758
      },
      "text": "together. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.520630985915493,
        "y0": 0.5772068965517241,
        "x1": 0.9501718309859154,
        "y1": 0.5899327586206897
      },
      "text": "PLY. To bend ; to consent, or comply. Still",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07084788732394366,
        "y0": 0.584394827586207,
        "x1": 0.5011943661971832,
        "y1": 0.5984327586206897
      },
      "text": "PLUCKING. The worsted plucked from the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.5925258620689655,
        "x1": 0.8056422535211267,
        "y1": 0.6029189655172413
      },
      "text": "in use in Dorset, Barnes's Gl.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09230422535211268,
        "y0": 0.5993655172413793,
        "x1": 0.4890535211267606,
        "y1": 0.6111706896551725
      },
      "text": "machine while the wheel is turning. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5194169014084508,
        "y0": 0.6023862068965518,
        "x1": 0.9497690140845071,
        "y1": 0.6314275862068965
      },
      "text": "PLYER. A very common bawd. PLYMOUTH-CLOAK. A cane, or stick. So",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07084788732394366,
        "y0": 0.6114293103448276,
        "x1": 0.3546507042253521,
        "y1": 0.6254344827586207
      },
      "text": "PLUERE. Weeping. {J.-N.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07084788732394366,
        "y0": 0.6238603448275861,
        "x1": 0.5007943661971831,
        "y1": 0.6513551724137931
      },
      "text": "PLUF. A tube of tin through which boys blow peas. Line. Also called a pluffer. PLUFE. A plough. Yorksh. PLUFFY. Spongy ; porous. Devon. It is some- times explained, soft, plump.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07084788732394366,
        "y0": 0.6912603448275862,
        "x1": 0.377312676056338,
        "y1": 0.7198965517241379
      },
      "text": "PLUG. A dwarfish fellow. East. PLUM. (1) Light ; soft. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.6313879310344828,
        "x1": 0.9505774647887324,
        "y1": 0.6574258620689655
      },
      "text": "because we use a staff in cuerpo, but not when we wear a cloak.\"",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5412788732394366,
        "y0": 0.6328051724137931,
        "x1": 0.7165774647887324,
        "y1": 0.643151724137931
      },
      "text": "called, says Ray, '•",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5194169014084508,
        "y0": 0.6554931034482758,
        "x1": 0.7558478873239437,
        "y1": 0.6711793103448276
      },
      "text": "PO. A peacock. {A.-S.)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6165802816901408,
        "y0": 0.671698275862069,
        "x1": 0.8072647887323944,
        "y1": 0.6843327586206897
      },
      "text": "A pruest proud ase a po,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6165802816901408,
        "y0": 0.6856793103448275,
        "x1": 0.8019971830985916,
        "y1": 0.6957931034482758
      },
      "text": "Seththe weddeth us bo.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
