        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5186056338028169,
        "y0": 0.7091051724137931,
        "x1": 0.9501718309859154,
        "y1": 0.7237137931034483
      },
      "text": "POACHED. Land is said to he poached vihtn it",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.7213758620689655,
        "x1": 0.3364281690140845,
        "y1": 0.7337741379310345
      },
      "text": "(2) Sensible ; honest. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.7349724137931034,
        "x1": 0.3408788732394366,
        "y1": 0.747401724137931
      },
      "text": "(3) Very ; exceedingly. Kent.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.7486775862068966,
        "x1": 0.2692225352112676,
        "y1": 0.7608172413793104
      },
      "text": "(4) Straight ; upright ; perpendicular. Plum downe, Cotgrave in v. Escarps.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07125352112676057,
        "y0": 0.7730431034482759,
        "x1": 0.4995830985915493,
        "y1": 0.8134275862068965
      },
      "text": "(5) Plum round, quite round. \" Make their attire to sit plum round,\" Harrison, p. 172. Plumfat, Florio, p. 33.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
