      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0696338028169014,
        "y0": 0.8519931034482758,
        "x1": 0.4995746478873239,
        "y1": 0.8676793103448276
      },
      "text": "PLUMED-SWAN. A white colour. One of the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8388394366197184,
        "y0": 0.8521275862068965,
        "x1": 0.8432901408450704,
        "y1": 0.8569206896551724
      },
      "text": ";",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.577712676056338,
        "y0": 0.8575551724137931,
        "x1": 0.9497577464788732,
        "y1": 0.8803724137931035
      },
      "text": "For they love none but for theyr poche. The Complaynte of them that ben to late Maryed.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09109014084507043,
        "y0": 0.8690741379310345,
        "x1": 0.32225915492957746,
        "y1": 0.8801293103448276
      },
      "text": "terms of ancient alchemy.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5186056338028169,
        "y0": 0.8788396551724138,
        "x1": 0.9501802816901409,
        "y1": 0.8943189655172414
      },
      "text": "POCHEE. A dish in ancient cookery consisting",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0696338028169014,
        "y0": 0.8794879310344828,
        "x1": 0.44654647887323945,
        "y1": 0.9080068965517242
      },
      "text": "PLUMMY. Soft ; wet ; mouldy. Devon. PLUMP. (1) Dry ; hard. Kent.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5404676056338028,
        "y0": 0.8951172413793104,
        "x1": 0.8728422535211267,
        "y1": 0.9069741379310345
      },
      "text": "principally of poached eggs. Pegge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5190112676056338,
        "y0": 0.9067206896551724,
        "x1": 0.7169915492957747,
        "y1": 0.9208275862068965
      },
      "text": "POCHERS. Potters?",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07044225352112676,
