        "x1": 0.33683661971830986,
        "y1": 0.9221310344827586
      },
      "text": "(2) A clump of trees. North.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0692281690140845,
        "y0": 0.9202224137931034,
        "x1": 0.49958028169014085,
        "y1": 0.947605172413793
      },
      "text": "(3) A crowd of people ; a mass of anything. It is sometimes a verb, to collect together.",
